# Political Triumph: "Whenever a creature you control enters, scry 1 and put a plan counter on this enchantment. When the
# fourth plan counter is put on this enchantment, sacrifice it, draw a card, and put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you
# control." Bot1 casts it and three Ornithopters on turn 1: each scries 1 (the first puts the Swamp on the bottom, the
# others keep what they see on top) and adds a plan counter, and with three the enchantment is still there. Bot2's own
# Ornithopter entering on turn 2 adds nothing ("a creature you control"). The fourth Ornithopter on turn 3 puts the fourth
# plan counter on it (CR 122.6, 603.2): it is sacrificed, Bot1 draws the Mountain, and each of the four Ornithopters gets
# a +1/+1 counter; Bot2's does not.

